  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the mains exam fees payment for the Post of <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Excise Constable&nbsp;posts</strong></span>. This&nbsp;<span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span>&nbsp;was released for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"903\">820 posts</strong>. Applications for the <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">UPSSSC Excise Constable</span> Various Post Recruitment 2026 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1003\">04 June 2026</strong></span> to <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1053\">24 June 2026</strong></span><strong>.</strong>&nbsp;The examination is going to conducted on&nbsp;<strong>20 September 2026</strong>. Candidates who had applied this form can download their <strong>UPSSSC Excise Constable Pay Mains Exam Fees Payment&nbsp;2026</strong> from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Excise Constable Mains Exam Fees Payment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- 08 Exam 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span 